WEBVTT

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:02.216
And I met the farmers,
the Guarnizo brothers.

00:11:02.240 --> 00:11:05.496
It's a small farm, they make great coffee,

00:11:05.520 --> 00:11:08.416
they're paid above
fair-trade prices for it.

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:11.456
And they showed me
how the coffee is grown.

00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:16.056
The bean is actually inside
this fruit called the coffee cherry.

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:18.256
And I thanked them.

00:11:18.280 --> 00:11:21.496
And they said,
"Well, we couldn't do our job

00:11:21.520 --> 00:11:23.736
without 100 other people."

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:27.616
The machine that depulps the fruit
is made in Brazil,

00:11:27.640 --> 00:11:30.696
and the pickup truck
they drive around the farm,